title: "TraceContract: verifiers of session-derived coding tasks and the corrections they miss"
abstract: >-
  Correction-aware task contracts and reward-fidelity auditing for coding tasks rebuilt
  from agent sessions: a pipeline, frozen verifiers, sandboxed grading, the recorded runs
  and the manuscript "When the First Request Is Not the Task: Verifiers of
  Session-Derived Coding Tasks and the Corrections They Miss". An automated study:
  all labels are model proposals, and no human labels exist.
